face-image: img/danat_bank.jpg

= Banking Crisis

The Darmstädter und Nationalbank, or Danat Bank, has collapsed! Along with it goes much of the Commonwealth banking system. The cause seemed to be due to the government's pursuit of a customs union with Austria, which led to de facto international sanctions. This has set off a global ripple effect, deepening the depression and driving foreign banks into bankruptcy.

This is a bourgeois dispute, but the costs will be borne by the proletariat. The people are facing ever-increasing hunger and poverty, and perhaps we are partly to blame.

- @nothing_to_do: There is nothing we can do.
- @stabilization: Take action to stabilize the economy!
- @austerity_toleration: Chancellor Askew's response is, as always, more austerity.
- @austerity_majority: Chancellor Askew's response is, as always, more austerity.
- @austerity_snaps: Chancellor Askew's response is, as always, more austerity.
- @austerity_goerdeler: Chancellor Goodlake's response is, as always, more austerity.
- @austerity_hitler: Chancellor Gallax's response is more austerity.  With extra racism, of course.
- @austerity_wirth: Chancellor Werth's response is, reluctantly, more austerity.
- @end_toleration: We are tired of austerity. End the toleration arrangement!

@nothing_to_do
view-if: marcher_in_government = 1
on-arrival: welfare -= 1; commons_marcher -= 3; disfavored_marcher -= 3; pro_republic -= 3

There is, essentially, nothing we can do.

@stabilization
view-if: marcher_in_government = 1
subtitle: -1 budget 
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have the necessary budget. [? if budget <= 0 and budget >= -3 and wtb_adopted = 1: The <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> will call a pre-emptive vote of no confidence.?] [? if wtb_adopted = 0: Our own party doesn't support running a budget deficit.?] [? if budget <= 0 and economic_minister_party != "Marcher": Our current coalition's economic minister refuses to support this course of action.?]
choose-if: budget >= 1 or (wtb_adopted = 1 and budget >= -3 and (in_marcher_majority = 1 or in_social_catholic_coalition = 1 or in_weimar_coalition = 1 or in_left_front = 1 or in_popular_front = 1) and economic_minister_party = "Marcher")
on-arrival: commons_marcher += 3*(1-dissent); burgher_marcher += 3*(1-dissent); guild_marcher += 2*(1-dissent); landed_marcher += 2*(1-dissent); disfavored -= 2; inflation += 1 if inflation < 0; budget -= 1; commons_royalist -= 3; economic_growth += 1; coalition_dissent += 1 if budget <= 0 and (in_social_catholic_coalition = 1 or in_weimar_coalition = 1 or in_popular_front = 1)

In the face of the banking crisis, we have taken emergency action to stabilize the economy by injecting money into the banking system. It might not be enough, but it temporarily staunches the bleeding.

