We are tired of [+ chancellor +]'s policy of austerity. After [+ chancellor +]'s attempt to use emergency powers to pass another welfare cut, we have worked with the other parties to reverse this policy. In response, the Assembly has been dissolved, and new elections called.

New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

